    "That opens the iPhone's own file picker, so you can upload straight from **iCloud Drive**, On My iPhone, or any other Files location.": {},
    "The **AI Assistant** is the one exception: when you use it, the relevant terminal output (and any files you attach) is sent to the model provider you configure — Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, or Hugging Face — using **your own API key**. Nothing is sent until you use the assistant, and your key is stored in the iOS Keychain. Review your provider's privacy policy for how they handle that data.": {},
    "The API key was rejected. Check it in AI Settings.": {},
    "The Terminal": {},
    "The assistant wants to run:": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يريد المساعد تنفيذ:"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El asistente quiere ejecutar:"
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "העוזר מבקש להריץ:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手想要运行："
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助理想要執行："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bar above the keyboard has **esc**, **ctrl**, **tab**, arrow keys, and more.": {},
    "The default for all hosts. \"Off\" keeps the current behavior. Individual hosts and groups can override this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الإعداد الافتراضي لكل المضيفين. «إيقاف» يبقي السلوك الحالي. ويمكن للمضيفين والمجموعات فرادى تجاوزه."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El valor predeterminado para todos los hosts. «Desactivado» mantiene el comportamiento actual. Los hosts y grupos individuales pueden anularlo."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ברירת המחדל לכל המארחים. ״כבוי״ משאיר את ההתנהגות הנוכחית. מארחים וקבוצות בודדים יכולים לעקוף זאת."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有主机的默认设置。“关闭”会保持当前行为。单个主机和群组可以覆盖此设置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有主機的預設值。「關閉」會保持目前的行為。個別主機和群組可以覆寫此設定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file lands in the folder you are currently viewing.": {},
    "The first time you connect to a server, Pockterm shows its key **fingerprint** and asks you to accept it. This is called trust on first use.": {},
    "The provider is overloaded. Try again shortly.": {},
    "The remote shell ended.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انتهت الصدفة البعيدة."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El shell remoto ha terminado."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "המעטפת המרוחקת הסתיימה."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "远程 shell 已结束。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遠端 shell 已結束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal output%@ will be sent to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيُرسل مخرج الطرفية%@ إلى %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La salida del terminal%@ se enviará a %@."
          }
        },
        "he": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "פלט המסוף%@ יישלח אל %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "终端输出%@将发送给 %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終端機輸出%@將傳送給 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
